l},{"id":28432947750,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAgUK288AAAABJvOt8c8AAAAGnrxaJg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/28432947750","actor":{"login":"bramhanandlingala","id":261630146,"node_id":"U_kgDOD5gowg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261630146?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala","html_url":"https://github.com/bramhanandlingala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bramhanandlingala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"38fba30fdf64383d9eacf1d3e34c0aa2cd3f6f37","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bramhanandlingala/airflow/commits/38fba30fdf64383d9eacf1d3e34c0aa2cd3f6f37","created_at":"2026-07-24T11:17:21Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5109555052","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/70231#issuecomment-5109555052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70231","id":5109555052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABMI2fbA","user":{"login":"potiuk","id":595491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTQ5MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/595491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk","html_url":"https://github.com/potiuk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/potiuk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T20:52:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T20:52:57Z","body":"It's quite deliberate. There are two versions of uv:\n\na) constraints \nb) Dockerfile\n\nThey are not necessarily the same - `uv` is used to both - install airflow and used by airflow as installer for venv. It's **impossible** to make it perfecly aligned - because one is fixed at the moment where Dockerfile is updated and one the other (constraint) is set when you use `uv` as extra and use constraints. We can choose either one or the other in the Dockerfile - and we choose the Dockerfile one.  Usually they will be few versions apart so this is not an issue.\n\nYou can still run `uv pip install \"apache-airflow[uv]\"==3.3.0 --constraints ~/constraints.txt` if you want to install constraints versions. \n\nThis is the same case with `pip` - but it rarely gets different as it moves way slower than `uv`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5109555052/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"potiuk","id":595491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTQ5MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/595491?v=4","g